# ==========================================
# Repository maintenance quarantine (see EWP-MAINT-001)
# ==========================================
# _to_delete/ is a standing quarantine location used when the local
# execution environment cannot permanently remove a file. It can grow to
# contain large tarballs, stale build caches and other non-source cruft
# that must never be committed to repository history.
_to_delete/
